<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέδρος</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cedar-tree</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδμὴ κέδρου . . θύου τ᾽ ἀνὰ νῆσον
					ὀδώδει δαιομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.60
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀπὸ κ. ἄλειφαρ γινόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.87
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				4.75
			</span></i>; applied to <i>prickly cedar, Juniperus Oxycedrus</i>,
			Od.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.12.3
			</span></i>; <i>Syrian cedar, J. excelsa</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.77
			</span></i>; <i>Phoenician cedar, J. phoenicea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.2.3
			</span></i>; <i>Himalayan cedar, J. macropoda</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.1.29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. μικρά</span>
			<i>juniper, J. communis</i>, Dsc.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>anything made of cedar- wood: cedar coffin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				365
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1141
			</span></i>; <i>cedar box</i>, for a bee- hive, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.81
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>cedar-oil</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ κ. ἀλείφειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Ind.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέδρον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
